    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Read Me\nThis Grafana workspace monitors Anish's personal Mac with Prometheus + node_exporter.\n\nDashboards:\n- Mac System: Core Health \u2014 CPU, memory, disk usage (including AnishSSD + Time Machine), disk I/O\n- Mac Network: Connectivity & Wi\u2011Fi \u2014 throughput, errors/drops, ping health, Wi\u2011Fi signal/rates\n- Mac Info: Identity & Status \u2014 system identity, key specs, running launchd services\n- All Metrics: Live Explorer \u2014 all active Prometheus metrics (live only)\n\nRetention:\n- Prometheus data retention: 14 days\n- Storage cap: 20 GB\n\nExporters and launchd:\n- node_exporter (Homebrew service)\n- Custom exporters (launchd): net_connectivity, mac_system_info, launchd_metrics\n- Root daemon: wdutil_metrics for Wi\u2011Fi metrics\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Read Me",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current value for Uptime.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - node_boot_time_seconds",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "title": "Uptime",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current value for CPU Cores.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mac_system_kv{key=\"cpu_cores\"}",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU Cores",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current value for Total Memory.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "node_memory_total_bytes",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "title": "Total Memory",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current value for Disk Used (/).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"}) / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "title": "Disk Used (/)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current value for AnishSSD Used (%).",
